msgstr "在准星外围画一个圆环"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:131
msgid "Ring radius"
msgstr "外圈半径"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:135
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "颜色"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:136
msgid "Crosshair color"
msgstr "准星颜色"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:137
msgid "Dark outline"
msgstr "深色描边"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:137
msgid "Keeps the crosshair readable on bright backgrounds"
msgstr "亮色背景上也能看清准星"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:138
msgid "Outline color"
msgstr "描边颜色"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:139
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "不透明度"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:139
msgid "1.0 is fully opaque"
msgstr "1.0 为完全不透明"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:143
msgid "Position"
msgstr "位置"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:145
msgid "Monitors"
msgstr "显示器"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:147
msgid "All monitors"
msgstr "所有显示器"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:148
msgid "Primary monitor"
msgstr "主显示器"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:149
msgid "Monitor with the active window"
msgstr "活动窗口所在显示器"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:158
msgid "Force monitor index"
msgstr "强制指定显示器序号"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:159
msgid ""
"-1 uses the selection above; 0, 1, … shows the crosshair only on that monitor"
msgstr "-1 表示使用上面的选择；0、1…… 表示只在这一块屏显示"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:160
msgid "Horizontal offset"
msgstr "水平偏移"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:161
msgid "Fine-tune when the crosshair is not perfectly centered"
msgstr "准星没有精确居中时用来微调"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:162
msgid "Vertical offset"
msgstr "垂直偏移"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:166
msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

#: ext/prefs-ui.js:166
msgid ""
"Displays a customizable crosshair at the center of the screen to help with "
"aiming in fullscreen games. It is drawn by GNOME Shell directly on the "
"topmost UI layer, so it stays visible above fullscreen windows and never "
"blocks mouse or keyboard input."
msgstr ""
"在屏幕中央显示一个可自定义的准星，方便在全屏游戏中瞄准。准星由 GNOME Shell 直接"
"绘制在界面最上层，因此全屏游戏中也始终可见，且不会拦截鼠标键盘输入。"

